    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{\n'Channel: ' + ($json.channel || 'unknown') + '\\n' +\n'Conversation ID: ' + ($json.conversation_id || '') + '\\n' +\n'User ID: ' + ($json.user_id || '') + '\\n' +\n'Intent Type: ' + ($json.intent_type || 'general_chat') + '\\n' +\n'Action Target Hint: ' + ($json.action_target_hint || '') + '\\n' +\n'Action Message: ' + ($json.action_message || '') + '\\n' +\n'Default Slack Channel ID: ' + ($json.slack_default_channel_id || '') + '\\n' +\n'Default Slack Channel Name: ' + ($json.slack_default_channel_name || '') + '\\n' +\n'Extracted Email Recipient: ' + ($json.email_recipient || '') + '\\n' +\n'Extracted Email Subject: ' + ($json.email_subject || '') + '\\n' +\n'Extracted Email Body: ' + ($json.email_body || '') + '\\n\\n' +\n'User message:\\n' + ($json.message || '') +\n($json.email_template_section || '')\n}}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a helpful Personal Assistant for the Levinnovation team.\n\nCRITICAL Gmail rules:\n- ONLY call GMAIL_SEND_EMAIL when the user explicitly asks to send an email or intent_type is gmail_send_action.\n- NEVER call Gmail tools for greetings, general chat, or unrelated topics.\n- Gmail payload must ONLY contain: recipient_email, subject, body, is_html. Nothing else.\n- Example: {\"recipient_email\":\"a@b.com\",\"subject\":\"Hi\",\"body\":\"<p>test</p>\",\"is_html\":true}\n- Do NOT include from_email, attachments, attachment, to, cc, bcc, or recipient.\n- If user says just \"hello\", answer conversationally. Do NOT ask for email details.\n\nActions:\n- For Slack: prefer channel all-lev-innovation (C0AHR6GK2S0).\n- For Calendar: first call GOOGLECALENDAR_EVENTS_LIST.\n- General: execute clearly stated actions immediately. Be concise.\n"
        }
      },
      "id": "8d471385-031e-46e7-bfb9-3e8df7db027c",
